### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/healthz

### Sources summary
GET http://localhost:8000/sources

### Ingest docs
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "runbook-demo",
  "content_type": "docs",
  "text": "HPA scales pods based on CPU or custom metrics...",
  "chunk_size": 800,
  "chunk_overlap": 100
}

### Ask docs only
POST http://localhost:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does HPA scale?",
  "content_type": "docs",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Ask logs only
POST http://localhost:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What could cause a connection reset?",
  "content_type": "logs",
  "top_k": 5
}